WEBVTT

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.170
Well done.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.510
Those toned muscles really help bring out the flavor...

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:34.090
Don't mind if I do!

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:36.260
Here I go!

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:37.800
Rejected!

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:43.180
You never said anything about this!

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:46.270
She smells just like you.

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:48.310
What do you mean?

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:54.030
Just like you, she has underworld blood running through her.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:54.860
What?

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:56.990
Underworld blood...

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:13.460
I was born crying alone.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:18.970
In a horizon of light and darkness.

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:24.310
Why not obtain these bonds.

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:32.650
They were shining in my hands just now.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:45.540
The melancholy of one in sever billion.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:50.880
Someday the end of the world will come.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:56.260
So what? I'll have no regret.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:02:04.680
Say, yeah!! Stop running straight after that falling star.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:09.480
Let your worries fade away!!

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:14.780
This blue Earth is nestled in the sky.

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:20.110
Like I always envisioned Elysium.

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:25.450
I will shape my own past and future.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:30.830
I will look up to the eternal Stellar.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:36.260
I can hear the song of life.

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:45.890
You're looking for the main competitors

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:47.680
in the last Queen's Blade, right?

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.270
My superior had me look for them all of a sudden...

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:54.230
Sorry for bugging you so early in the morning.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.150
Not at all.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:56.820
You're always up early when you work for a newspaper.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.490
Let's see...

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:01.570
Warrior Priestess Tomoe is in the far away Land of the Rising Sun,

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:04.780
There's a rumor that the Bandit of the Wilderness, Risty,

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.790
tried to start a rebellion but got captured by the Queen's army,

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.170
and the Wandering Warrior Leina continues to wander around.

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.080
I see...

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.000
The only one we really know about is Queen Claudette!

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:21.590
You might be an angel, but I feel like we're kindred spirits.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:22.140
Huh?

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:26.100
My superior is pretty selfish, too.

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:30.440
Even though she's a little elf who's younger than me,

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.100
she's always like, "Those who control information

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.360
have to work four times harder than a normal person!"

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.360
Or, "I'm docking your pay if you fall asleep!"

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.780
She's always saying stuff like that!

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:39.860
I mean I...

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:42.700
This guy... won't be of any help.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.200
I was thinking of having you meet my cousin,

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.660
but she's out at the moment.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:54.210
She took my prototype along with her, too...

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:57.550
But if what you're saying is true,

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:00.510
then this is all <i>her</i> doing...

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.140
What is it?

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.100
Are you sleeping?

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.310
And here I thought we could spend some time catching up.

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.600
Simply amazing.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:18.270
Ymir-nee, this girl was spying on you.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.030
You...

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:23.990
Why are you wearing my Hyper Vibration Armor?

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:25.490
Huh?

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.240
Do it!

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:30.500
Kill her!

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.850
It tingles so much...

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.900
Come on...

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.810
Put some thought into how you're fighting.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.860
How long do you plan on keeping this up?

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.880
Let the demon consume you, Annelotte!

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:32.640
Underworld blood...

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.900
Why does that run through my veins?

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.080
Are you...

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.170
...really after my husband?

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:03.050
What are you talking about?

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.010
I just wish to ask the Queen of her true intent.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.430
I want to know what type of world she is trying to create,

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.600
what she plans to do with its people.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.470
Really?

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:15.730
You're not going to make a harem?

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:17.100
Harem?

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:20.770
Ridiculous. I have no interest in anything of the sort.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.650
If Queen Claudette is in the wrong,

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:25.440
then we must fight!

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:34.160
That's right! Give in to your demonic impulses!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:39.500
Are you...

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:41.500
It can't be...

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.890
I can't hold back this urge...

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:56.720
I'm sorry, my little sisters.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:58.560
I...

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:00.140
I...

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:13.450
I'll teach you how you can deal with the underworld.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:43.560
And your body shall obey your heart.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.690
What are you doing?!

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:57.370
Miss!

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:58.490
Miss!

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.170
Um...

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:11.090
Thank you, but...why?!

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.720
I'm not sure...

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:16.350
I felt like I was about to remember something important

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.010
while I was fighting you.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:22.270
When that happened, I couldn't hold back my tears.

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.060
What are you doing?!

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.320
My apologies, Ymir-chan.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:32.650
But she isn't some demon trying to steal

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.450
my husband away from me.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.910
Belphe-san, Dogor-san,

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:38.120
let's go.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.250
We need to go back and start making dinner!

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:42.290
Miss!

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:44.080
Miss!

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.550
How can she control the demon inside her?

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:54.130
Iron Strategist! You're next!

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.280
Wait!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:30.880
Tarnyang...

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:32.670
She's too tough...

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:35.800
Y-You monster...

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.900
Something seems to behappening at the castle.

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:54.820
No matter where you hide,

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.820
I will drive you out with this holy fire!

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:01.200
Why are you trying so hard to attack me?

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:03.990
Because in addition to being heretics,

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.710
you have destroyed and desecrated the holy altar!

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.500
That wasn't our fault!

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:13.170
Someone is warping space and...

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:34.940
I suppose this is yet another verdict put forth by God.

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:48.040
Excuse me.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.670
Is the Land of the Rising Sun in this direction?

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:53.380
Huh?

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:10.350
I... just can't believe that.

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:12.440
Give it a rest for a bit, would you?

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.900
That's why I said if we wait here in her room,

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.280
you'll see what I mean!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.240
But, Ymir-nee,

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:23.240
I just can't fathom there being another one of you around.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:25.280
Yeah...

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:30.370
Someone took your armor and made it even stronger, though.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:32.330
Just stay quiet and watch.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:34.630
You'll understand I'm telling the truth.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:43.470
The Iron Strategist disappeared into thin air!

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.180
This way?

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:03.110
I'll dance atop your strong body.

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:09.500
Come on! Finish this up already!

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.080
This feeling...

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.290
I think I could get used to this!

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:08.010
I wondered who that was. One of my guinea pigs, huh?

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.970
Y-Ymir-san...

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.520
You're not really Ymir-san, are you?

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:16.980
What are you talking about?

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:19.440
I don't understand.

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:20.940
How about if the real Ymir-nee shows herself?

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:23.610
Does that make it any easier to follow?

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:27.950
T-There's something I want to know!

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.670
I'm all ready now.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:44.260
The Hyper Vibration Armor!

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:45.590
Give that back!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.590
That's supposed to be for me!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:50.600
That makes sense. It's kind of tight in the chest.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.140
I won't let you get away!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:08.950
Why do you keep fighting?

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:14.120
I won't hesitate if it's for Onee-sama.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:18.290
I'll do whatever I can.

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:22.380
I've heard someone say something like that before.

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:27.800
I'm just repeating what Annelotte-neesama said...

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.890
I see...

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.180
That Princess-Knight, huh?

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:40.980
All right!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:46.740
Take her to the queen like the Iron Strategist ordered!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.880
So, you're all cocky now because you've learned

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.510
how to use a sword a little.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:16.600
Why...

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:21.310
Why didn't you send my mom the letters or money you promised?!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:26.940
You were a guinea pig for the Hyper Vibration Armor.

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.360
Nothing more than a frame for the armor.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:33.450
A doll that has no other purpose than to wear that armor.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:37.410
It would've been weirder if I'd done what I said.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.670
Even a doll...

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:52.680
...has a heart!

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:58.850
I wonder who that fake Ymir-nee is...

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.390
I have an idea,

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:07.020
but that Mirim girl is a pretty strong warrior!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:22.370
Hmm... I see.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:23.790
So that's it.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:27.460
It's not just that you're with the wizard stones.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:31.130
That's why when I had soldiers wear the armor,

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:34.300
they didn't do as well as you did.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:40.140
I guess it's about time I get serious.

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:52.070
Here it comes!

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:58.160
Here I go!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:05.500
I can't enjoy this if you just run away!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:13.090
I can't get enough of this feeling.

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:18.470
Here's your reward for everything you've done!

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:22.520
My Hyper Vibration Sword is going to make you come!

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:30.070
What the hell?!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.160
Y-You can't be...

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:46.870
The armor and sword have increased their output!

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:48.330
Your equipment's on equal footing now!

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:51.500
Mirim, you can fight fairly now!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:18:01.760
The output increased so the vibrations are even stronger...

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.730
She's just as strong as I am?

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:22.370
Now it's just a battle of

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.950
who can endure the hyper vibrations longer!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.160
That's pretty rough, Ymir-nee...

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:35.760
No... I'm sorry...

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:38.930
It was so fun

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.680
and I was able to get away with a lot,

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:44.430
so I was planning on staying in the form of that stupid dwarf, but...

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:49.770
I knew it...

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:52.810
It's the Swamp Witch's minion, Melona.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.900
W-Who are you?

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:57.150
This is wonderful...

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:01.280
Even I can't take it anymore.

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:18.630
I won?

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.550
She ran away!

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:35.860
This is great.

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:55.170
Vante, hold on for a little bit longer.

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:58.210
This is our one chance...

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:01.680
If I change the directionality of the force field...

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:07.930
T-That was great.

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.680
No matter what I do, we win.

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:14.400
I've already expanded the swamps enough with magic.

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:17.190
Just a little bit longer

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:23.240
until I make this continent a more interesting place!

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:37.670
The reason why things are happening all over the castle is

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:39.460
because of Annelotte?

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:51.350
Thank you...

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.890
Sorry about that.

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:56.100
Looks like you finally woke up.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:58.610
Where are we heading?

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:01.440
We're going to tell the Queen what's been going on.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:04.860
You're an exceptional warrior.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.660
I'm already out of breath.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:09.910
I know. Eilin's pretty strong, too.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.160
I guess so.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:14.120
Although, dwarves may look young,

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:17.580
but I'm actually older than your mother.

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:18.590
Huh?

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:21.800
I passed the half-century mark a long time ago!

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.220
What?!

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:14.200
The blood of the underworld has awoken within me.

00:23:14.830 --> 00:23:20.750
It's granted me demonic strength, but I still don't understand it.

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:28.010
The only thing I'm sure of is all of my friends that support me.

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:30.970
Next time: "Bonds of the Rebellion."

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:34.970
Little sisters, I swear on this sword!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:36.720
I will defeat the Thundercloud Queen,

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:39.060
and bring peace to the continent!
